"media, finance, web/SEO, file management, and more. All tools run in your "
"browser—no installation required."
msgstr ""

#: .\tools\templates\tools\faq.html:22
msgid "Is my data safe?"
msgstr ""

#: .\tools\templates\tools\faq.html:23
msgid ""
"Most tools process data locally in your browser or send it only for the "
"specific operation (e.g., translation, meta tag check). We do not store or "
"log your personal data. For sensitive content, always check the privacy "
"policy."
msgstr ""

#: .\tools\templates\tools\faq.html:26
msgid "Does it work on mobile?"
