#: .\tools\templates\tools\faq.html:105
msgid ""
"Reload the page, make sure JavaScript is enabled, and temporarily disable "
"strict blockers or extensions that may interfere. If the problem continues, "
"note the tool name, your browser, and what you were doing when it failed."
